]\ndocs/design/yin.vm.code-as-tuples.md:1522: [:db/add ev :yin.ledger/profile  {:yin.lower/profile \"ast-to-bytecode\" :yin.code/contract \"v2\" :yin.k/version 0}]\ndocs/design/yin.vm.code-as-tuples.md:1608: [:db/add ev :yin.ledger/output     tree-out-addr]       ; on success\ndocs/design/yin.vm.code-as-tuples.md:1649:`:yin.ledger/output` and `:yin.ledger/macro` as addresses; the other event\ndocs/design/yin.vm.code-as-tuples.md:1900: :where [?d :yin.ledger/op :derive] [?d :yin.ledger/output ?seg] [?d :yin.ledger/input ?tree]\ndocs/design/yin.vm.code-as-tuples.md:1901:        [?x :yin.ledger/op :expand] [?x :yin.ledger/output ?tree] [?x :yin.ledger/input ?src]]\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm.cljc:1081:(defn validate-rows\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/ast_walker.cljc:724:(defn vm-load-rows\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/ledger.cljc:52:(defn derive-record\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/ledger.cljc:62:   :yin.ledger/output output\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/ledger.cljc:64:   :yin.ledger/profile lowering-profile})\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/ledger.cljc:76:   [:db/add ev :yin.ledger/output output]\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/ledger.cljc:78:   [:db/add ev :yin.ledger/profile profile]\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/ledger.cljc:92:        record (derive-record root segment)]\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/ledger.cljc:162:      vector against the record's `:yin.ledger/output`. A mismatch\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/ledger.cljc:166:      address must equal `:yin.ledger/output`. Inequality reports\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/ledger.cljc:194:         (let [output (:yin.ledger/output record)]\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/ledger.cljc:197:         (let [profile (:yin.ledger/profile record)]\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/ledger.cljc:202:         (let [output (:yin.ledger/output record)\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/ledger.cljc:249:               [?d :yin.ledger/output ?seg]\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/code.cljc:370:(defn well-formed-vector?\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/semantic.cljc:528:(defn load-image\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/semantic.cljc:719:(defn load-vector\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_code.cljc:667:(defn register-image-defect\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn/register.cljc:106:(